{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c637b8c9c7446424ae76f632d32d6992e9eed3c427600d6286fc17f0917959a1", "ja": "（今日は瑞希の宣材写真撮影だ。\nどんな写真に仕上がるか、今から楽しみだな）", "zh": "（今天瑞希来拍摄宣传照。\n会拍出怎么样的照片呢？真令人期待。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "f247839fa3fe7df96fb112c4ba4e4d6c3b67a19cd8469553eaabdce0980ac804", "ja": "{$P$}。\nちょっと、いいでしょうか。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a429e285f3602cedecc2bdddf92697bd50a7afe0e00aa4db2fc9f5c609a1d3a2", "ja": "大丈夫だけど、どうかしたのか？　瑞希。", "zh": "是没问题，怎么了吗？瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "e6cf308be1015eb1a65d112c47210defb7568901f68f649ad310c5fa13971fa2", "ja": "はい。\n実は、もう少し撮影を待ってもらいたいのですが。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n其实，我希望拍摄可以稍微延后一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cb5837d940026d72e23ae45b749edacd557e96272560a6896ffab303bc1cf1b4", "ja": "撮影を？　まだ機材のセッティング中だから、\n少しなら大丈夫だと思うけど……。", "zh": "延后拍摄？现在还在设置器材，\n延后一点时间应该是没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "6c47f32e828c789d7ed80fa2ff3643841da042f7fed71c97e50324431ae4e3b2", "ja": "少しなら……。", "zh": "一点时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "e4f7ed5d17ecae3ed8ce42503f1f5ba8db04501e07150490ef71cf0ab582dca4", "ja": "すみません、嘘をつきました。正確に言うと、\n少しではなく、たくさん待ってもらいたいのです。", "zh": "对不起，我说谎了。正确来说，\n我希望不只延后一点时间，而是很长一段时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cb8b7c46c73db85cd2d10daf58f27b9f17d29cf8eb20a3c0947edf2dbaa9d5a8", "ja": "たくさん……って、どのくらいだ？", "zh": "很长一段时间……那么，到底是多长呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "d86f5c1148edafe8984eec720354177373e23774e14fb94b2b60795ce46cba51", "ja": "わかりません。\nただ、場合によっては3年ほど。", "zh": "我也不知道。\n不过，看情况可能要3年左右。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "892edb3b20d54cce590b25dfe7b5fa38863cf6ab14cdec81a5e3ccfc0e2f2894", "ja": "3年！？", "zh": "3年！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "52d544cf4bda3a5e7bc803b12f3ac270e89196e4374e452a12b65b705d609d26", "ja": "はい。日にちに直すと、1095日です。\nうるう年が入る場合、そのかぎりではありません。", "zh": "是的。换算成天数的话，是1095天。\n再考虑到闰年的话，可能会更多天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c6298c6a52c8cd06641dab74aeeafcda089740d1601c05435028e3875c597330", "ja": "いや、直さなくていい。というか、いくらなんでも\nそんなに待てないって。一体、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "不，不用帮我换算。我要说的是，\n再怎么样都不可能等那么久啊。到底发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "57d0b897c8433b22afea47d5970eb137898530227decabba0c88ca5ae7faa070", "ja": "はい。実は昨日、眠る前にふと考えたのですが。\n私は、アイドルとしては少々……。", "zh": "是这样的。其实，我昨天睡前突然想到一件事。\n我要当一个偶像，有些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "ae49a9b772718130a520020ada917f41acfdf1877b5577a035e6c927c77ad2eb", "ja": "いえ、かなり、物足りないみたいです。歌もダンスも、\nまだまだ素人です。それから、胸の辺りも……。", "zh": "不，是有很多不足的地方。无论是唱歌或跳舞，\n我都是外行人。还有，我的胸部也不太……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "e6d72ab1fc0d0918ae2e659b0edeb391dc3e04eedbc5a81374feaf706a8bfa25", "ja": "それから、胸の辺りも……。", "zh": "还有，我的胸部也不太……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6c1f2b5284c53deb3f1ed753c4eb1e3c57a70a48c7fc96a5ade44ae82bf5a9fd", "ja": "わ、わかったから。それで？", "zh": "我、我懂了。所以呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "5d459fe9d46b8a24aaf2774a5de9e4ed74adc429c42f9ba2894b64e39b66a3fe", "ja": "なので、みなさんが納得できるレベルに成長してから\n撮ってもらった方が、いいのではないかと。", "zh": "所以，我认为等我成长到大家都能接受的程度之后，\n再来拍摄或许会比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "67b0e73b1df8fb22eeb766afb1d85a328d2d3f66199af728d7047ee2d9d4c908", "ja": "そういう理由で3年か……。", "zh": "因此才要等3年是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "ef5f94dcc2b0b347cf9b7558c72428cd5b9055b843d1e4cadf88e08a7e6cb5ed", "ja": "ご安心を。心配せずとも、母はナイスバディーです。\n……将来性はあるぞ。", "zh": "请放心。不需要担忧，我的母亲身材很棒。\n……所以我的将来也值得期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "01640f4971e302f4cdae0781d9bd7acae64ce20b953555fa865b81732964090d", "ja": "そうだな、瑞希。けど……", "zh": "有点道理，瑞希。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_1020", "source_sha256": "dce9317cf2b75d642ef9be8815ac9bbccd9a2db0074d47d615f86b3b610771f9", "ja": "今撮ろう", "zh": "还是现在拍吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "cb468717e62bde5d0c107077055a53d838d1bae9fcf7e0d6c3f842e89939be8d", "ja": "だからこそ、今撮るべきなんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我觉得正因为如此，才更应该趁现在拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2002_p", "source_sha256": "436fda3ce80dfbf1afd8f7dfe359a61a758b004938e5ff531c3855aa81409b8f", "ja": "成長過程をファンのみんなに見守ってもらえるのも、\nアイドルの魅力のひとつだと思うんだ。", "zh": "让粉丝见证你成长的过程，\n我认为这也是偶像的魅力之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2004_044miz", "source_sha256": "81d77a8bf5292f3cef84852b54f8e4de8e55747a225b5d5445283cb5d8f904ea", "ja": "目からウロコです。つまり、未知の可能性も含めて、\nアイドル。……ということでしょうか。", "zh": "真是令人茅塞顿开。也就是说，\n未知的可能性也是偶像的一部分……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2005_p", "source_sha256": "08c44636a0afaed297d5cb7a0f65ce22118ebd93bc1530f9116a974cb6b59bbd", "ja": "そういうことだ。ファンにとっては、\nアイドルの成長も楽しみのひとつだからな。", "zh": "就是这样。因为对于粉丝来说，\n期待偶像的成长也是一种乐趣啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2006_044miz", "source_sha256": "a3767db4c1df3b6c8ba8ff59c50055ee4643b5b16dfd9309d23bc69e66acc4c7", "ja": "成長が楽しみ……なるほど、わかりました。\nつまりアイドルとは、祖父母と孫のようなもの。", "zh": "期待成长……原来如此，我明白了。\n也就是说，粉丝和偶像就形同祖孙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2007_044miz", "source_sha256": "241e77f0439a05027e682a832e02af93e370364d26d946ee105aa979527f454e", "ja": "確かに、親戚のマサルくんの成長は、\nとても興味深いです。……楽しい、と言えるかも。", "zh": "我家亲戚有个小孩叫阿胜，\n我对他的成长确实很感兴趣……这或许也是种乐趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2008_044miz", "source_sha256": "c9780fc2a7c95f800f950f4e8f5f35aa8a8a03b0fe807dd83f27d31d36dc0ef5", "ja": "そしてマサル君の記念写真は、親戚内でも評判……。", "zh": "而且阿胜的纪念照在亲戚之间也大获好评……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2009_p", "source_sha256": "c8339b16c193c9c976d3ff9202f3b6cbc39e51b907e7c6f1c27d641d4be3dc88", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nマサル君も愛されてるんだな。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n看来阿胜备受关爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2010_044miz", "source_sha256": "6d11ea2ded0d490c205133d7fbb98f7143d6c1b9e202c01c41e274de65b0d379", "ja": "はい。そして、これから撮る写真は、\n私の、アイドルとしての成長記録。", "zh": "是的。而接下来要拍的照片，\n也是在记录我作为偶像的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2011_044miz", "source_sha256": "033041aaeff13ed999510e89fa0e53dda96cc407ab6981c5b60f928507394097", "ja": "つまり、記念撮影、ということでしょうか。", "zh": "也就是说，应该也能算一种纪念照吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2012_p", "source_sha256": "c792d1b53969eb14f481d06eff858953f83c4c1e921b3a8bb5f413f93d927753", "ja": "そういう一面もあるかな。成長する瑞希の姿、\n変化していくところを、1枚ずつ残していこう。", "zh": "或许也能那样解释吧。那我们就留下一张一张的照片，\n记录瑞希成长、变化的过程吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2013_044miz", "source_sha256": "1d3689574e1eac4bc2cfeae1ba28449cb7fae12dccacc9d16c1690cda0cdfb68", "ja": "わかりました。では、撮ってください。\n今の私を、存分にアピールしたいと思います。", "zh": "好的。那么，请开始拍吧。\n我想要尽情地展现出现在的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2014_044miz", "source_sha256": "96e84e1093ce3415282c252c4a7c49de10adb5d7797e514e71dab0e07566fcf6", "ja": "……未来の瑞希に負けないくらい、可愛く写るぞ。", "zh": "……我要拍得很可爱，不能输给将来的瑞希哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_002_2015_p", "source_sha256": "0d8a8a40e9b546671657b9a1bb9f0fd1f3fb15cecf390c0527aae679ffac5bf8", "ja": "（カメラの前に立つ準備ができたかな。\n今の瑞希を、しっかり切り取ってもらおう！）", "zh": "（看来她准备好要上镜头了。\n将现在的瑞希好好撷取下来吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
